      {
        "id": 132324,
        "name": "Killswitch",
        "username": "Killswitch",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/killswitch/{size}/2116_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-19T22:14:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Greywind\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/greywind/48/2006_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Greywind:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>Savage Mana</em> can only hold targets. Haka doesn't have the means to destroy anything else. I don't recall Tempest having any targets beyond his own character card.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Note that I presumed that with Imbued Vitality in play, thus converting them to targets, they could count as targets being destroyed. I could be wrong.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:07:47.480Z",
