        "created_at": "2015-02-19T22:35:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>At that point, when the question is asked whether or not the destroyed card goes under <em>Savage Mana</em>, the answer should be \"no\". Otherwise, the other heroes may not want to play with Haka no more.</p>",
