        "cooked": "<p>Quoting the link,</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Limited cards cannot be intentionally played.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This confuses me.  Is it only for duplicates?</p>",
