      {
        "id": 132334,
        "name": "AlexxKay",
        "username": "AlexxKay",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-24T00:34:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If Absolute Zero has a Modular Realignment in his hand, and is expecting some (partial) equipment destruction to come along soon, he could well want to dump a copy of a Limited-and-in-play card into his trash.&nbsp; Whether he should be *able* to is, of course, a matter of opinion. But there's at least one legitimate use case.</p>",
