      {
        "id": 132336,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-24T03:08:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And the rather more obscure case where you want to trigger Iron Legacy's Vigilance so that you can hit him with Combat Stance, but your only cards in hand are Limited copies.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>A second copy of a limited card in play doesn't ever get played for any reason.&nbsp; It goes directly to the trash rather than going from play to discard.</p>",
